roject scope', 'osous' ); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Cameras, software, recording, networking, cabling, and door systems are assessed together.', 'osous' ); ?></p></article><article class="reason"><h3><?php esc_html_e( 'Local project coordination', 'osous' ); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Our Baghdad and Erbil teams coordinate the agreed delivery locations, site access, and implementation schedule.', 'osous' ); ?></p></article><article class="reason"><h3><?php esc_html_e( 'Clear ownership and handover', 'osous' ); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Operator training, documentation, administrator access, and support responsibilities form part of the agreed scope.', 'osous' ); ?></p></article><article class="reason"><h3><?php esc_html_e( 'A practical path for existing systems', 'osous' ); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e( 'We review reusable equipment and upgrade dependencies before recommending replacement or expansion.', 'osous' ); ?></p></article></div></div></section><section class="section soft" id="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><h2><?php esc_html_e( 'Avigilon Iraq: Frequently Asked Questions', 'osous' ); ?></h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'What is the difference between Avigilon Unity and Alta?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Unity is built around on-premises video and access-control deployments, with optional cloud-connected capabilities. Alta provides cloud-based management. The right choice depends on connectivity, recording location, existing equipment, administration, and recurring costs.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Is Avigilon Control Center the same as Unity Video?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Unity Video is the current product name associated with the former Avigilon Control Center (ACC) platform. An existing ACC installation may need software, hardware, and license checks before an upgrade; a name change does not make every upgrade automatic or free.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Can you supply and install Avigilon systems in Iraq?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Osous Al Taqnia helps define the equipment, licensing, installation, and support required for Avigilon projects. Work is coordinated from Baghdad and Erbil, with on-site arrangements for Basra and other locations agreed in the project scope.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Can we keep our existing CCTV cameras?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Possibly. Compatibility depends on the camera model, firmware, connection method, platform, and features required. ONVIF support alone does not guarantee every function. We assess recording, audio, events, analytics, and any connector or license requirements.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'How much recording storage do we need?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Storage depends on camera count, bitrate, recording schedule, retention days, and the selected recording architecture. We size usable capacity and allow for RAID overhead and growth. The final design should also account for server throughput and playback demand.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Will the system work if the internet connection fails?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Behavior depends on the platform, hardware, storage location, and feature. Local recording or door decisions may continue in a correctly designed system, while remote management and some cloud functions may be unavailable. We define and test the required outage behavior.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Can Avigilon video and access control work together?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Supported Unity or Alta configurations can associate access events with video. We verify the software versions, controllers, cameras, licenses, and integration requirements before committing to a particular workflow.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Does license plate recognition work for Iraqi vehicles?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Plate recognition must be checked against the selected product, software version, supported plate formats, and deployment conditions. Camera angle, lighting, vehicle speed, and plate visibility affect results. A pilot with representative local vehicles helps validate the proposed setup.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'What affects the price of an Avigilon system in Iraq?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'The main factors are camera models and quantity, controlled doors, recording retention, storage, software licenses, cloud subscriptions, network and cabling work, installation, and support. We prepare a quotation against the agreed scope rather than a camera count alone.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Can you help with an existing Avigilon Blue installation?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Avigilon lists Blue as a discontinued product. We can assess the existing environment and scope a transition to an appropriate current platform. Reuse of cameras, migration options, and service availability must be checked for that installation.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'Does the quotation include maintenance and on-site support?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Only the services explicitly included in the proposal are covered. Manufacturer warranty, installation support, ongoing maintenance, and monitoring are distinct. The agreement should define service hours, response arrangements, visits, and exclusions.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details><details><summary><?php esc_html_e( 'What information should we provide for a quotation?', 'osous' ); ?></summary><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Share the site location, floor plans if available, approximate camera and door counts, coverage priorities, retention period, existing equipment, and project timeline. These details help us plan a survey and prepare a suitable solution scope.', 'osous' ); ?></p></details></div></div></section><section class="section" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact"><h2><?php esc_html_e( 'Request an Avigilon Solution in Iraq', 'osous' ); ?></h2><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Planning a new CCTV installation, access control, additional cameras, or an upgrade to an existing Avigilon system? Tell us what you need to protect and how your team operates.', 'osous' ); ?></p><p><?php esc_html_e( 'Share your location, approximate camera and door counts, retention requirement, and timeline. We will help define the equipment and services for your proposal.', 'osous' ); ?></p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:info@osoustaqnia.com?subject=Avigilon%20CCTV%20and%20Access%20Control%20Enquiry"><?php esc_html_e( 'Request an Avigilon Quote', 'osous' ); ?></a></div></div></div></section></main>
